<para>Here are the instructional activities for the lesson:</para>
<list>
  <item>1.2.1: Finding the Percent of 200</item>
  <item>1.2.2: Modeling with Equations to Find Edges in Platonic Solids<list>
      <item>1.2.2: Self Check</item>
    </list>
    <list>
      <item>1.2.2: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item>1.2.3: Writing Equations to Represent Relationships<list>
